{
  "_comment": "R17-A3 / T1 — deterministic offline fixture for the Java application change-based ingestor (JavaAppIngestor). Models the OPERATIONAL surface only (Spring Boot Actuator health/metrics/info samples + application logs) — phase one reads what a running app exposes, NEVER its source code (AC8). 'payments-api' shows runtime friction (health flips UP->DOWN, error-rate/p99-latency/heap pressure rise, ERROR+exception logs); 'inventory-api' is healthy and quiet (one nominal sample, no error logs) so incremental and empty-delta behaviour can be exercised. Actuator samples carry observed_at timestamps; log entries carry monotonically increasing per-app offsets. No credentials are present in offline mode.",
